<nav><div class="w"><b>Business Win Now</b><div><a class="k" href="#services">Services</a><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#sample">Sample</a><a class="k" href="#contact">Contact</a></div></div></nav>
<header class="hero"><div class="w"><h1>Done-for-you AI services that win you more business</h1>
<p>Listing photos &amp; reels for real estate agents, proposal support for government contractors, candidate shortlists for staffing agencies, sponsor &amp; guest matchmaking for podcasts and newsletters, and email and checkout fixes for Shopify brands.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#services">See all 5 services</a><a class="btn o" href="mailto:businesswinnow@gmail.com?subject=Free%20sample%20request">Request a free sample</a><p class="em">Everything handled by email &mdash; no calls required.</p></div></header>
<section id="services"><div class="w"><h2>Services</h2><p class="note"><b>Everything handled by email &mdash; no calls required.</b> Tell us what you need, get a free sample of the work, and decide from there. Prices are starting points; final quotes are given up front.</p><div class="grid s"><div class="card svc"><h3>MLS Virtual Staging &amp; Listing Reels</h3><p class="for"><b>Who it&rsquo;s for:</b> Real estate agents and brokerages</p><b>What you get</b><ul><li>Restyled (virtually staged) room photos for the listing</li><li>A 15-second vertical walkthrough clip per listing</li><li>Delivered as a listing pack, ready to post</li></ul><div class="from">From $99&ndash;$249 per listing pack<br><span style="font-weight:400;font-size:.9rem">Monthly brokerage retainer available.</span></div><a class="btn" href="mailto:businesswinnow@gmail.com?subject=Free%20sample%3A%20MLS%20virtual%20staging">Request a free sample</a></div><div class="card svc"><h3>GovCon RFP Compliance Matrix &amp; Proposal Drafting</h3><p class="for"><b>Who it&rsquo;s for:</b> Small federal and state contractors</p><b>What you get</b><ul><li>A compliance matrix built from the solicitation and amendments</li><li>Bid/no-bid summary and proposal outline</li><li>First-draft technical response</li></ul><div class="from">From $300&ndash;$1,500 per proposal</div><p class="lnk">See the sample: <a href="sample-compliance-matrix.pdf">PDF</a> &middot; <a href="sample-compliance-matrix.xlsx">Excel</a></p><a class="btn" href="mailto:businesswinnow@gmail.com?subject=Free%20sample%3A%20GovCon%20compliance%20matrix">Request a free sample</a></div><div class="card svc"><h3>Candidate Shortlists &amp; Resume Tailoring</h3><p class="for"><b>Who it&rsquo;s for:</b> Boutique tech staffing agencies</p><b>What you get</b><ul><li>A 3-candidate shortlist or skill matrix for each open req</li><li>Resumes tailored to the job requirements</li><li>Matched to your exact job ID</li></ul><div class="from">From $300&ndash;$500 per shortlist<br><span style="font-weight:400;font-size:.9rem">Or a monthly sourcing seat.</span></div><a class="btn" href="mailto:businesswinnow@gmail.com?subject=Free%20sample%3A%20candidate%20shortlist">Request a free sample</a></div><div class="card svc"><h3>Podcast &amp; Newsletter Sponsor / Guest Matchmaking</h3><p class="for"><b>Who it&rsquo;s for:</b> B2B creators, podcast hosts, newsletter writers and founders</p><b>What you get</b><ul><li>Sponsor matching for your show or newsletter</li><li>Guest pitching with custom angles for each show</li><li>Media kits</li></ul><div class="from">20&ndash;30% commission on sponsorship deals<br><span style="font-weight:400;font-size:.9rem">Or $1,000&ndash;$2,500/mo for guest booking.</span></div><a class="btn" href="mailto:businesswinnow@gmail.com?subject=Free%20sample%3A%20sponsor%20or%20guest%20matchmaking">Request a free sample</a></div><div class="card svc"><h3>Checkout &amp; Email Retention Teardowns</h3><p class="for"><b>Who it&rsquo;s for:</b> Shopify and DTC brands</p><b>What you get</b><ul><li>An audit of your welcome and abandoned-cart emails</li><li>A review of your product pages</li><li>Paste-ready rewritten copy for your email platform</li></ul><div class="from">From $1,000&ndash;$3,000 setup<br><span style="font-weight:400;font-size:.9rem">Plus monthly management.</span></div><a class="btn" href="mailto:businesswinnow@gmail.com?subject=Free%20sample%3A%20email%20retention%20teardown">Request a free sample</a></div></div></div></section>
<section id="what-we-do"><div class="w"><h2>What we do for federal bids</h2><div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Bid/no-bid summaries</h3>A one-page brief on scope, set-aside, deadlines, evaluation factors and red flags, so you can decide fast.</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Compliance matrices</h3>Every "shall," instruction and evaluation item pulled from the solicitation and mapped to where your response answers it.</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Outlines &amp; first drafts</h3>A proposal outline that follows the instructions, plus first-draft technical narrative ready for your edits.</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Deadline tracking</h3>Question deadlines, amendments and due dates (with time zones) tracked so nothing slips.</div></div></div></section>
<section id="how"><div class="w"><h2>How it works</h2><div class="grid">
<div class="card step"><b>1</b><h3>Send the bid</h3>Email the SAM.gov link or solicitation number.</div>
<div class="card step"><b>2</b><h3>We break it down</h3>We read the RFP/RFQ and amendments and build your compliance matrix and bid summary.</div>
<div class="card step"><b>3</b><h3>We draft</h3>Outline and first draft of the technical volume, written to the evaluation criteria.</div>
<div class="card step"><b>4</b><h3>You finalize</h3>You add pricing and past performance, review and submit. You stay in control.</div></div></div></section>
<section id="why"><div class="w"><h2>Why Business Win Now</h2><div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Federal project background</h3>Founder Ben is a mobile software engineer who has worked on federal projects, including the Library of Congress LOC Collections app (2019&ndash;2021) and the MyMilitary Health Care app (2024&ndash;present).</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Based in Washington, DC</h3>Close to the agencies, industry days and contractor community.</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Fast turnaround</h3>Compliance matrices and bid summaries delivered quickly, so you have more time before the deadline.</div>
<div class="card"><h3>You keep control</h3>Your pricing, past performance and final decisions stay with you. We do the heavy lifting on the documents.</div></div></div></section>
<section id="pricing"><div class="w"><h2>GovCon pricing</h2><div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>First matrix</h3><div class="price">Free</div>Your first compliance matrix on a live bid costs nothing. See the quality before you pay.</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Per proposal</h3><div class="price">$300&ndash;$1,500</div>Flat fee, based on solicitation size and scope. Quoted up front.</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Optional win bonus</h3><div class="price">If you win</div>Lower flat fee plus an agreed bonus only when you win the award.</div></div></div></section>
<section id="sample"><div class="w"><h2>Sample work</h2><p>A sample compliance matrix for a real, open VA solicitation: RFQ 36C26026Q1017 (Portland VA EMS Quality Assurance Inspection SaaS, SDVOSB set-aside, NAICS 541519).</p>
<a class="btn" href="sample-compliance-matrix.pdf">Download sample matrix (PDF)</a><a class="btn" href="sample-compliance-matrix.xlsx">Excel version</a></div></section>
<section id="contact"><div class="w"><h2>Contact</h2><p>Have a bid on your list? Send the solicitation number and we'll start your free matrix.</p>
